Package: co2e
Title: Global Warming Potential Lookups and CO2-Equivalent Conversion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Joe", "Corra", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides curated Global Warming Potential (GWP) values from
    IPCC Assessment Reports 4 through 6, gas name standardization across
    common naming conventions (ASHRAE, chemical formula, CAS number), and
    CO2-equivalent conversion utilities. Values are verified against
    official IPCC source tables rather than taken from secondary
    compilations; see the package vignette for source-by-source provenance
    notes, including a documented discrepancy in published AR6 CFC-11/
    CFC-12 values.
